  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with water, add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat.\n• Thinly slice pear (see ingredients).\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/680f1ece988c8394285bf7d0/step-b8f5c700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook egg fettuccine in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 3 minutes.\n• Reserve pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people). Drain fettuccine, then return to saucepan and drizzle with olive oil.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/680f1ece988c8394285bf7d0/step-dc535810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil. Cook sliced mushrooms, tossing, until browned and softened, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Stir in thickened cream and vegetable stock. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/680f1ece988c8394285bf7d0/step-49c7f920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cooked fettuccine, half the Parmesan cheese and the reserved pasta water to the pan. Toss to combine.\n• Remove pan from heat. Add a drizzle of truffle oil (if using) to taste. Season with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: Truffle oil has a strong flavour. Add less, or leave it out, if desired.\n• TIP: If the sauce looks too thick, add a splash more of the reserved pasta water to loosen.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/680f1ece988c8394285bf7d0/step-b6c10230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, combine the honey with a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl. Season to taste, then add pear and rocket leaves. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/680f1ece988c8394285bf7d0/step-28eae440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop parsley.\n• Divide deluxe mushroom and truffle fettuccine between bowls. Sprinkle with parsley and chilli flakes (if using).\n• Sprinkle remaining Parmesan over salad.\n• Serve pasta with the rocket, pear and Parmesan salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/680f1ece988c8394285bf7d0/step-b0d8c850.jpg"
    }
  ]
